		<h1 class="article-header__title">Non-Volatile Memory Renaming for Safe Batteryless Computing</h1>
					<div class="article-header__subtitle"><p>This work introduces NvMR, an architecture that addresses the challenges of using non-volatile memories in batteryless devices.</p>
